<title>USA: IPO FILING - LHS Group Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - LHS Group Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		   LHS Group Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			LHSG.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $14-$16/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered *  5,883,000</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 5,000,000</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  883,000</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    25,050,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Goldman Sachs &amp; Co</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  882,450 shrs</p>
<p>* Note: of the total shares offered by the company, four million shares will be offered in the United States and one million will be offered on the international market.</p>
<p>Of the total offered by the shareholders, 706,400 shares will be sold in the United States and 176,600 shares will be available for sale in the international market.</p>
<p>Business: provider of client/server-based billing and customer care solutions to providers of wireless and wireline telecommunications services in the Americas, Europe and Asia.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: General Corporate purposes, including working capital.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended Dec 31:</p>
<p>				   1996		 1995</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $56,864	    $26,967</p>
<p>   - Net Income	     $3,420		 $284</p>
